Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: @DEB_HOST_ARCH@
Depends: adduser, debconf (>= 0.5) | debconf-2.0, libc6
Provides: mako-lua-abi-@LUA_VERSION@ (= @LUA_VERSION@)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Alexander Rykovanov <alexander@realtimelogic.com>
Homepage: https://makoserver.net/
Description: embedded web server with a Lua runtime
 Mako is an application server that embeds Lua and loads Lua applications and
 native modules from configurable paths. This package includes the runtime,
 its matching resource archive, and an optional unprivileged systemd service.
